From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 15 May 2026 07:34:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Add bundle files to gitignore

Exclude *.bundle files from git tracking since they are temporary
archives used for transferring commits between environments.
---
 .gitignore | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
 create mode 100644 .gitignore

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..7b402e8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+*.bundle
-- 
2.43.0

